// The app icon the installed executable carries (SPEC R11.1), so Explorer, the
// taskbar, the window title bar, and Settings -> Apps show it. The id is 1
// because GPUI's Windows backend loads the window class icon with
// `LoadImageW(module, MAKEINTRESOURCE(1), IMAGE_ICON, ...)`.
//
// This file sits at the crate root and names the icon from there because
// `embed-resource` runs `rc.exe` and `windres` with the build script's working
// directory, while `llvm-rc` gets the resource file's own directory.
// `build.rs` compiles it for Windows targets only.
1 ICON "icons/icon.ico"
